# Organic growth

This repo fell into over-planning **twice** (full architecture / unused auth-DB width before a vertical worked). Do not do it a third time.

Full lesson: `docs/organic-growth.md`. Current system: `docs/current-architecture.md`. Domain vision (not a build checklist): `docs/application_idea.md`.

- One slice that runs, then the next. Do not scaffold Nx, Prisma, extra OAuth vendors, admin UI, blacklist, or password login “for later”.
- When **planning or implementing** a product slice, follow `.cursor/skills/feature-recipe/SKILL.md` (chunks, questions, delete the working plan).
- Do not treat `_archived_docs/` or deleted implementation plans as the live backlog.
- Widen a port or migration only when the current story needs it.
- Before proposing a new layer, provider, or doc set, read `docs/organic-growth.md`.
